      "created_at": "2021-10-21T15:40:14.685Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No, I wasn’t going to allow that to stand! Every card she plays is one step closer to <strong>THAT</strong> card, so I had O-X dart her (just like the card art!) to remove Channel the Eclipse and Return with the Dawn. Then I wiped out the underlings so they wouldn’t come back.</p>\n<p>Name of the game was basically give all the plays to Tachyon via Timeshift, Swift Summoning, and Experiment. Once her trash filled up, she did one big punch and it was nearly over from there!</p>",
